An opener past a hosted container's column opens there

```
- ::: box
    ::: |
    x
    :::
  :::
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="box">
      <div class="line-block">
        <p>x</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

